    justification:  # 1f6c
    description: "GenServer.call(UserCache, :ping) where UserCache is an Elixir alias produces zero otp_call/otp_cast edges. otp.py does direct dict lookup on handler_index with no suffix fallback. Fix: add suffix-match fallback (like Phoenix route_handler has) or resolve aliases using the Elixir analyzer's _extract_alias_hints output. HIGH severity — nearly every real Elixir codebase uses module aliases for cross-module GenServer calls."  # 1f6c
